"""Management API Routes — Phase 22 + Phase 24.

Provider-neutral REST endpoints that expose existing Phase 13-21
backend services (Discovery, Health, Graph, Monitoring, Fault,
Alert, Visibility, Operation/Recovery) as read-only and preview-only
APIs under /api/v1/.

SAFETY PRINCIPLES:
    - All GET endpoints are read-only
    - POST /operations/preview and /recovery/preview are preview-only
    - POST /discovery/run triggers read-only provider exploration only
    - No shell commands or external process calls
    - No provider mutation API calls (no START/STOP/RESTART/REDEPLOY/SCALE)
    - No recovery executor invocation
    - No operation service invocation
    - No kubeconfig or credential creation/modification

This module contains ONLY HTTP boundary code + response mapping.
No business logic is implemented here.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

